rpmconstant
------------------------------------------
This small libraries find constant in rpm header and provide function to find
value <=> constant name pair.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libpopt0-1.19-1
  librpmconstant0-0.1.5-1bl2

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libpopt-devel-1.19-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  rpm-devel-4.18.0-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/rpm-software-management/rpmconstant

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/rpm-software-management/rpmconstant/archive/refs/tags/0.1.5.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack rpmconstant-0.1.5-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./rpmconstant-0.1.5-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/rpmconstant-0.1.5-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/rpmconstant-0.1.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/librpmconstant0-0.1.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/librpmconstant-devel-0.1.5-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(rpmconstant)
  /usr/bin/rpmconstant.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/rpmconstant.README
  /usr/share/doc/rpmconstant/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/rpmconstant/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/rpmconstant/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/rpmconstant/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/rpmconstant/README

(librpmconstant0)
  /usr/bin/cygrpmconstant-0.dll

(librpmconstant-devel)
  /usr/include/rpmconstant/rpmconstant.h
  /usr/lib/librpmconstant.dll.a

